==Quests==
;Attunement
Though attunement is no longer required, the quest still remains in-game and can be completed if desired. The player title of [[Champion of the Naaru]] was awarded to those that completed the original attunement quests for this raid and [[Serpentshrine Cavern]], but is no longer available. The quests to complete the attunement for The Eye are given by [[A'dal]] in [[Shattrath City]] after successful completion of [[The Cipher of Damnation (quest)]] questlines in [[Shadowmoon Valley]].
